<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is conducting sweeping operations, artillery shelling and demolishing homes in southern Lebanon, targeting Hezbollah positions and civilian structures. Hezbollah faces legal pressure as Lebanese authorities have charged five members with recruiting and arming others, while sanctions have been imposed on a Lebanese charity and gold companies for aiding the group. The World Bank reports that reconstruction in Lebanon is progressing slowly. The conflict has caused civilian casualties, including children, as noted in recent violations reports. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOdVVVdTQwWndfVktET0dIb2pHaWVCdGZvak9VbE04V1Nad1NpOGd5LTZDVTJ2SHlqcjJiaF9iQ29ZaFV3Wi1RSVZLTC10MWIxMUwzZEx3ZGJnbVV1YkVtVGtjd3BZVGFoN2U0alREU3FKWHpTNE1MVHNCUjVLU0ZibGRjbmM3elEwNl9qNDFFdzlwc1pKS0pnUHQtSm1NOXRxcTM0UG5USzQ5aWNveWZ6R1R1dE1sWXByMW9KMHA3Qnd0SUJVVklsckMydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Straits Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5TRUpHMWU0WG5rWm92UkUxV0NpLU9PY0lPbGZ6SXhTaFo2aENsQUJfMWx0b0xSWkUybVBCZWVacmxXWUtmeTRYUFAzWDkwMWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQRnZYRGdDeWhFZmg1bWJCS1BhYVc3QXp0czVJaUtYZEFNNGJmLTR1YmIxbXNNa1dydTFmQzh5amhRd3UzNm04dkdScUJ0NVMwTzNTeFBsMUwwMFBaSGs5QXpsZmk1alhRdnFEUUhYc2NKU1A4VnFZdlMyTnJ2Yl9jcUVNU1V3U1JqbkRJUGZzenNVbTYyV1lNR2hBX2xDTEJCMHZnUDFDN0N4SVlmcjY2dVJNZ3pCcFpFYm1rTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jordan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQaVlRVDRGOUJTd1BXc243Smpva1lCRnlDZGFHWmpVa2tiTVN2SHVtY0tyd3RBaUN